          "type": null,
          "body": "Command used to generate files to add (which were manually reviewed and edited):\n\n`find . | grep \"\\.h$\" | grep -v \"./dissectors/\" | grep -v \"./plugins/\" | grep -v \"./ui/\"| grep -v \"./.git/\" |  xargs grep -L \"WS_DLL_PUBLIC\" |  xargs grep -L \"@file\"  | grep -v wiretap | grep -v capture | grep -v wsutil | grep -v \"include\" | grep -v \"extcap\" | grep -v epan | xargs gedit`",
